        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.271,
            0.812,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": "Hint: Observe that $\\angle \\mathrm { R E B }$ is a straight angle. Hence, the degree measure of $\\angle  REB  = 180^{\\circ}$ of which $8 0 ^ { \\circ }$ is covered by $\\angle \\mathrm { T E R } .$ A similar argument can be applied to find the measure of $\\angle \\mathrm { S E T } .$"
        },
